{% comment %}
  Prints the price a wholesaler pays for a variant, in cents, excluding GST.
  @param {object} variant
  - Wholesalers pay one fixed wholesale price per item, ex GST, with no volume discounts (James,
    19 Nov 2026).
  - The variant metafield custom.wholesale_price (Decimal, ex GST) is the price; it has to match
    the Dollarlabs B2B price list that charges it at checkout. Without it, Theme settings > APEX
    Feeds > Wholesale "Wholesale discount off RRP" takes a % off RRP. With neither, this prints
    nothing: no wholesale price is set (shown as "On request" / RRP only).
  Use: {%- capture wp -%}{%- render 'apex-wholesale-price', variant: variant -%}{%- endcapture -%}
{% endcomment %}
{%- liquid
  assign wp = variant.metafields.custom.wholesale_price.value
  if wp != blank
    assign cents = wp | times: 100 | round
    echo cents
  else
    assign pct = settings.apex_wholesale_fallback_discount | default: 0
    if pct > 0
      assign keep = 100 | minus: pct
      if settings.apex_wholesale_prices_include_gst
        assign cents = variant.price | times: keep | divided_by: 110.0 | round
      else
        assign cents = variant.price | times: keep | divided_by: 100.0 | round
      endif
      echo cents
    endif
  endif
-%}
